\begin_layout Standard
The preferences of Bio7 are opened with 
\series bold
Preferences
\series default
 in the main menu (on macOS in the application menu 
\series bold
Bio7
\series default
). The tree on the left side lists the preference pages of Bio7 (
\series bold
Preferences Bio7
\series default
 and its subpages) and of the Eclipse platform; the filter field above the tree finds a page by its name. 
\series bold
Restore Defaults
\series default
 resets the settings of a page, 
\series bold
Apply
\series default
 applies them and 
\series bold
Apply and Close
\series default
 applies them and closes the dialog. The screenshots of this chapter show the default settings of Bio7 4.0 (dark theme).
\end_layout

