\begin_layout Standard
Bio7 uses an installation of GDAL on the computer (raster and vector formats, coordinate systems) with the Foreign Function and Memory API. 
\series bold
Activate GDAL (loaded when it is used)
\series default
 and 
\series bold
Load GDAL at startup (in the background)
\series default
 enable GDAL. 
\series bold
GDAL library
\series default
 is the GDAL library (empty: automatic search); 
\series bold
Detect...
\series default
 searches it, 
\series bold
Test
\series default
 tests it (a new library is tested first in a separate process) and 
\series bold
Install GDAL...
\series default
 shows how to install GDAL. The status line shows the loaded library and the datum grids of PROJ.
\end_layout

